Original source: ciborium-ll/src/enc.rs (encoder) and ciborium-ll/src/hdr.rs (header types).

Modifications by InfiniteContext.com <blockchain@infinitecontext.com>:
- Extracted minimal encoding functions only (write_uint, write_bytes, write_text,
  write_array, write_map, write_null). No decoder, no serde integration, no Value
  type, no Tag support.
- Removed all external dependencies (original depended on ciborium-io).
- Simplified the major/minor header encoding into standalone functions.
- Added write_bool helper.

